    "Name": "Grand Titan T-IT-N18S",
    "Details": "The Grand Titan T-IT-N18S was an attempt to bring the Regulan -N14R \"Vengeance\" variant, a very specialized and morally questionable 'Mech, into mainstream use. It keeps the lasers but replaces the Thumper artillery piece and its \"alleged\" nuclear payload with an Improved Heavy Gauss rifle. It also reverts to standard armor and the original 400 XL engine, while borrowing the -N18M's speed enhancements, which gives it surprising maneuverability.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>",
    "Icon": "GrandTitan"
  },
